  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "## Changes since 8.5.x\n\n### Main package\n* Re-added limited .NET Standard 2.0 support - DateOnly, TimeOnly, UnixFileMode, and System.Numerics based extension methods are not supported on .NET Standard 2.0\n* Deprecated Process ``IsRunningOnRemoteDevice`` extension method - This is being replaced with the ``IsProcessOnRemoteDevice`` extension method\n* Deprecated Process ``RequestCancellationAsync`` and ``WaitForExitOrTimeoutAsync`` extension methods\n* Updated Process ``HasStarted`` and ``HasExited`` extension methods to throw an NotSupportedException if the Process is run on a remote device/machine.\n* Reworked IFormattable ``ToString`` extension method overload\n\n## Notes\n* 8.7 is currently intended as the final minor update (in Major.Minor.Build format) for version 8",
